{#
  The "général" field set, shared by the edit form and the creation form so
  the two can never drift apart.

  Requires `asset` (a Modules\Rental\Repository\RentalAsset, or null when
  creating) and `type_suggestions` (string[]). `field_prefix` (optional)
  only disambiguates the `id`/`for` attributes when both forms are on the
  same page — the POST field names are identical either way, since the two
  actions read the same names.
#}
{% set p = field_prefix|default('edit') %}
<div class="row g-3 mb-3">
    <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
        <label class="form-label" for="{{ p }}-name">Nom du bien</label>
        <input type="text" class="form-control" id="{{ p }}-name" name="name"
               value="{{ asset ? asset.name : '' }}" required maxlength="150">
    </div>
    <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
        {# A closed list, not a free field. The type is what the public index
           groups by and what a contract prints, so free text produced
           "Local", "local" and "Local scout" as three kinds of the same
           thing, and a typo was invisible until it reached a document. The
           list itself is configurable — a unit that lets out something
           nobody anticipated adds it once in « Configuration > Locations »
           rather than retyping it per asset. #}
        <label class="form-label" for="{{ p }}-asset-type">Type</label>
        <select class="form-select" id="{{ p }}-asset-type" name="asset_type" required>
            {% set current = asset ? asset.assetType : '' %}
            {% if current == '' %}
                <option value="" selected disabled>Choisissez un type…</option>
            {% endif %}
            {% for suggestion in type_suggestions %}
                <option value="{{ suggestion }}" {{ current == suggestion ? 'selected' : '' }}>
                    {{ suggestion }}
                </option>
            {% endfor %}
            {% if current != '' and current not in type_suggestions %}
                {# A type this asset was created with before the list was
                   narrowed. Kept selectable so saving the form does not
                   silently retype the asset, and flagged so somebody
                   notices. #}
                <option value="{{ current }}" selected>{{ current }} (hors liste)</option>
            {% endif %}
        </select>
        <div class="form-text">
            Pour ajouter un type, complétez la liste dans « Configuration &gt; Locations ».
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-6 col-md-3">
        <label class="form-label" for="{{ p }}-capacity">Capacité</label>
        <input type="number" class="form-control" id="{{ p }}-capacity" name="capacity"
               value="{{ asset and asset.capacity is not null ? asset.capacity : '' }}" min="1">
        <div class="form-text">Nombre de personnes. Vide si sans objet.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-6 col-md-3">
        <label class="form-label" for="{{ p }}-quantity">Quantité</label>
        <input type="number" class="form-control" id="{{ p }}-quantity" name="quantity"
               value="{{ asset ? asset.quantity : 1 }}" min="1" required>
        <div class="form-text">1 = bien unique. Plus de 1 = stock louable séparément.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-6 col-md-3">
        <label class="form-label" for="{{ p }}-arrival-time">Heure d'arrivée</label>
        <input type="time" class="form-control" id="{{ p }}-arrival-time" name="arrival_time"
               value="{{ asset and asset.arrivalTime ? asset.arrivalTime : '' }}">
    </div>
    <div class="col-6 col-md-3">
        <label class="form-label" for="{{ p }}-departure-time">Heure de départ</label>
        <input type="time" class="form-control" id="{{ p }}-departure-time" name="departure_time"
               value="{{ asset and asset.departureTime ? asset.departureTime : '' }}">
    </div>

    <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
        <label class="form-label" for="{{ p }}-emergency-phone">Téléphone d'urgence</label>
        <input type="tel" class="form-control" id="{{ p }}-emergency-phone" name="emergency_phone"
               value="{{ asset and asset.emergencyPhone ? asset.emergencyPhone : '' }}">
        <div class="form-text">
            Communiqué uniquement au locataire sur sa page de suivi. Jamais affiché publiquement.
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

{#
  The only publication switch there is. A public asset is listed on the
  /locations index — which is itself the module's single "Notre unité" menu
  entry — and reached from there; there is deliberately no per-asset menu
  entry to opt into, so this checkbox alone decides public reachability.
#}
<div class="form-check mb-3">
    <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="{{ p }}-is-public" name="is_public"
           {{ asset and asset.isPublic ? 'checked' : '' }}>
    <label class="form-check-label" for="{{ p }}-is-public">
        Rendre ce bien visible publiquement
    </label>
    <div class="form-text">
        Le bien apparaît alors sur la page « Locations » du menu « Notre unité ».
    </div>
</div>
